<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2</book>
  <para style="h">Korɛnti Filanan Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">2CO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Korɛnti Filanan</para>
  <para style="toc2">2KO</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitabu Filanan Kɔrɛntikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alla la Kuma Kitabu Filanan Kɔrɛntikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu filanan ɲin ye gbɛlɛya le yirakala Pɔli ni Korɛnti lemɛniya mɔɔilu tɛma. Mɔɔ doilu tɛrɛ ii tɛma, woilu tun da sika Pɔli la kelaya ma ii ka a bɔrɔbɔ. Wo ko ka Pɔli duɲa haan! Kɔni hali wo, a tɛrɛ a la kaninteya yirakala Kɔrɛntikailu la a ni a tɛrɛ ye ii la bɛn ɲa mɛn ma. Wo le rɔ, a ka ii tɔɔ ɲumailu lamɛn, ko koilu ra bɛn damira, a sɛwara (suran 7 kuma diya 5 haan 15).</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛbɛ damira, ale jɛrɛ ye mantɔrɔ juuilu le ɲafɔla, a ka mɛnilu sɔrɔn Efɛsi jamana rɔ (suran 1 kuma diya 1 haan 11), ka ko gbɛlɛn gbɛrɛilu fanan ɲafɔ mɛnilu taminnin a ni Kɔrɛntikailu tɛma. A ka kelaya baara tɔnɔ la ko fɔ, Maari Isa ka mɛn kelaya. Wo rɔ, a ka a ɲafɔ nfenna a ka a jɛrɛ kɛ mɔɔ ko gbɛlɛn di a la kitabu taminnin kɔndɔ a ni a sɛwanin ɲa mɛn ma wo la ko rɔ baa a ra a yen ko wo tɔnɔ ra to ii ma (suran 1 kuma diya 12 haan suran suran 7 kuma diya 16).</para>
  <para style="ip">A ka bolo ladɛn na ko fɔ ka bɛn Judiya jamana lemɛniya mɔɔilu la ko ma (suran 8 haan 9). A ka a fɔ Kɔrɛntikailu yɛ ko ii ye sɔli kɛ fonesereya rɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛbɛ laban ye kuma ɲa yɛlɛmannin dɔɔni (suran 10 haan 13). Pɔli ye kumala mɔɔilu ma mɛnilu ye a fɔla ko Isa la talibidenba tɛ ale ri. Sɛbɛ labannin kaninteya kumailu le ma (suran 13 kuma diya 11 haan 13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin kɔndɔ, Pɔli wa kɛ a la kelaya kun mafɔla, a ye Kibaro Ɲuma jɛrɛ kun mafɔla. Ni a karannin kosa a la kelaya fanka ye lɔn, a tɛrɛ wo kɛla le kosa mɔɔilu ye sɔn Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma ma, Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye lɔn Maari ri.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Duwawu ni tuwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Nde Pɔli mɛn kɛnin Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na talibidenba ri Alla sawo rɔ, nde le kitabu ɲin sɛbɛla ai ma, n ni n badenma Timote, ka a lawa lemɛniya jama ma Korɛnti so kɔndɔ a ni mɔɔ sɛnimanilu bɛɛ ma Akaya jamana bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />An Fa Alla ni Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni jususuma di ai ma.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli ka baraka bila Alla yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />An ye baraka bilala an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin Fa Alla yɛ, an Fa kininkinin tii, Alla mɛn ye mɔɔilu lalemɛniyala ko bɛɛ rɔ, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />mɛn ka an nalemɛniya an na tɔrɔyailu bɛɛ rɔ kosa an ye se mɔɔilu lalemɛniyala mɛnilu ye tɔrɔya ɲa su bɛɛ rɔ wo lemɛniya fɛ Alla ka mɛn di an ma. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />An ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye tɔrɔla an ɲɔɔn fɛ ɲa mɛn ma, an nalemɛniya ye warala Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ wo ɲa le ma. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Ni an tɔrɔra, wo kɛnin ai la wakali ni ai la kisi ko fɛrɛ le ri. Ni an ka wakali sɔrɔn, ai fanan di wakali sɔrɔn, kosa ai ye fanka sɔrɔn tɔrɔyailu rɔ, an wa tɔrɔ an ɲɔɔn fɛ waati mɛn na. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />An jii lanin ai rɔ fanan kosɛbɛ, baa an ka a lɔn ko an ye tɔrɔla an ɲɔɔn fɛ, an di lemɛniya sɔrɔn an ɲɔɔn fɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Nba, n badenmailu, an ka tɔrɔya mɛnilu sɔrɔn Asi jamana rɔ, an ye a fɛ ka ai lalɔn ko woilu la. Donin mɛn lara an kun ma, wo tɛrɛ gbiliman haan! An tɛrɛ tɛ a nɔ! An jiitɛɛra le, ko an tɛrɛ tɛ kisila saya ma. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />An tɛrɛ ra an miri ko saya ra latɛɛ an ma. Kɔni wo kɛnin de kosa an kana la an jɛrɛ la fɔɔ Alla mɛn ye mɔɔ faaninilu lawulila ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />A ra an kunka saya gbalo ma, a ri na an kunka diya fanan. An da an jii la Alla rɔ jati ko a ri to an kunkala ikɔ tuun, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />ai wa kɛ an dɛmɛnna Alla matara diya. Wo rɔ, mɔɔ siyaman di baraka bila Alla yɛ an na ko rɔ, Alla wa hina an na tuma mɛn na, mɔɔ siyaman na tarali ma.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli ka a diyanan koilu yɛlɛman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />An na jɛrɛmatɔɔ le ɲin di: An hankili ye sereya bɔla, an da taama dunuɲa rɔ Alla la sɛninya ni telen dɔ, a gbengben ai la ko rɔ. Mɔɔilu la walijiya tɛrɛ tɛ a ri, kɔni Alla la hina le tɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />An tɛ foyi sɛbɛla ai ma ai tɛ se mɛn karanna, ka a lɔn. A lɔɔ ye n na ai ye a lɔn a ɲuma la, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />ikomin ai ra a lɔn dɔɔnin ko an kɛnin ai la gbiliya le ri an Maari Isa na waati rɔ ikomin ai fanan kɛnin an ta ri ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />N lanin ɲin na, n ka a miri, ko n ye wa aile le tɔrɔfɛ fɔlɔ kosa ai ye a tɔnɔ sɔrɔn siɲa fila. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />N tɛrɛ ra a miri, n ye tamin ai tuwala n wa kɛ wala Masedoniya waati mɛn na. Wo kɔ rɔ, n kɔsɛtɔla ri tamin ai wara ka bɔ Masedoniya, ai ri n dɛmɛn wa ko rɔ Jude mara. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />N ka ko ɲin natɛɛ waati mɛn na, n ka wo kɛ fuu le rɔ wa? Wala, n na koilu ri kɛ ikomin adamaden doilu wa, n di «ɔn» a ni «ɛn-ɛn» kuma siɲa kelen do? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Kɔni Alla telennin, an ka kuma mɛn fɔ ai yɛ, wo kɛnin tɛ «ɔn» ni «ɛn-ɛn» siɲa kelen. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Baa Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin, Alla Dencɛ, Silasi ni Timote ni nde jɛrɛ ka mɛn na ko kawandili bɔ ai tɛma, wo kuma kɛnin tɛ kuma fila ri, ikomin «ɔn» a ni «ɛn-ɛn.» Kuma gbɛrɛ tɛ a rɔ, fɔɔ «ɔn!» waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Baa Alla ra an lahidi ko mɛn bɛɛ la, woilu dafanin Isa la kuma ɲin de fɛ ko «ɔn.» Wo le rɔ, an fanan ye a fɔla Isa baraka rɔ ko, «amina,» Alla gbiliya ko rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Awa Alla jɛrɛ le ka andeilu ni aile fanka don a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin fɛ. A ra an masusa tulu la an suwandi ko rɔ, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />ka a la tɔɔmasere la an ma, ka a la Nii Sɛniman nadon an jusu rɔ ka kɛ ikomin fen fɔlɔ mɛn donda an bolo tɔɔmasereya la kosa an ye la ko natɔilu la.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Alla le n sere ri, n da n kali n nii la: Ni n ma n kɔsɛ Korɛnti wo kɛnin de kosa n kana ai niilafin. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Na ka a fɔ ko an da fanka sɔrɔn ai la lemɛniya kun na, wo tɛ wo ri. Kɔni an ye baarala le an ɲɔɔn fɛ ai la sɛwa ko rɔ ka a masɔrɔn ai fanka donnin lemɛniya rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Wo le rɔ, n da a latɛɛ ko n kana n kɔsɛ ai wara niilafin dɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Baa ni n ka ai niilafin, yon de nde lasɛwala ka bɔ aile ma, n ka mɛnilu niilafin? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Wo le rɔ, n ka sɛbɛli kɛ ai ma, kosa n wa na ai wara tuma mɛn na, n jusu kana kasi ai la ko rɔ, aile mɛn ka kan ka kɛ n na sɛwa kun di. N lanin tɛrɛ a la, ko n na sɛwa ri kɛ ai la sɛwa ri. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />N ka wo sɛbɛli kɛ ai ma tɔrɔ ba ni jusu lafin ni ɲaji le rɔ. N tɛrɛ tɛ ai niilafin ko rɔ, kɔni n tɛrɛ ai lalɔnna le, ko n da ai kanin haan!<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ko juu kɛla makoto ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ni ai le do kɛra jama niilafin fɛrɛ ri, a ma nde niilafin, kɔni fɔɔ ai le jama bɛɛ, adon tuɲa ye mɛn di, a ka bɛɛ niilafin dɔɔnin. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Ai siyaman da a ɲakankatan, wo ra wasa. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Nba, sisɛn, fɔɔ ai ye wo tii makoto le, ka a lalemɛniya, kosa a jusu ti nala lafinna ba kɛ haan ka jiitɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Wo rɔ, n da ai madiya, ai ye ai la kaninteya yiraka a la. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Baa n ka a sɛbɛ ai ma le kosa n ye ai sɔn lɔn, ka a lɔn ko ni ai kolonin ko bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ai wa mɔɔ mɛn makoto, nde fanan di wo makoto. Nde wa mɛn makoto, ni makoto ko le tɛrɛ a ri, n ye wo kɛla aile le la ko rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin ɲakɔrɔ, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />kosa Setana kana an magbɛrɛn kɛ, baa an ka a la ko rabɛnniilu lɔn.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Nba, n wara Torohasi so kɔndɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase diya waati mɛn na, n ka a yen ko Maari ra da laka n yɛ ye. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Kɔni n hankili tɛrɛ tɛ siinin, ka a masɔrɔn n ma n badenma Tite sɔrɔn ye. Wo le rɔ, n ka ye mɔɔilu fo, ka wa Masedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa le lɔla an ɲɛrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Kɔni Alla tando, mɛn ye nɔli dila an ma Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ, ka lɔ an ɲɛrɔ ka wa yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ, a ri a lɔn dajɛnsɛn an fɛ ikomin fen suma duman mɛn ye jɛnsɛnna. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Baa an kɛnin de ikomin wusulan suma Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye mɛn janinna, ka a lase Alla ma jama bɛɛ tɛma, kisi mɔɔilu ni mɛnilu ye halakila. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />A kɛnin saya suma le ri mɔɔ doilu yɛ mɛnilu ye lawala saya rɔ, ka kɛ nii lakisi suma ri do gbɛrɛilu yɛ mɛnilu ye lawala nii lakisi rɔ. Yon di se baara ɲin kɛla? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Adon, andeilu kɛnin tɛ ikomin mɔɔ mɛnilu ye Alla la kuma kɛla julaya fen di. Kɔni andeilu ye kumala Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka le rɔ ka fara Alla la an jusu gbɛ rɔ Alla ɲakɔrɔ.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Teriya kura baarakɛlailu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />An da an jɛrɛ lanali damira ikɔ tuun wa? Wala an mako ye an dantɛɛ batakiilu le la wa mɛnilu ye an tɔnɔ fɔla ai yɛ wala ai ye mɛnilu sɛbɛla doilu ma an na ko rɔ ikomin mɔɔ doilu ye ɲa mɛn ma? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Aile jɛrɛ kɛnin an dantɛɛ bataki le ri, mɛn sɛbɛnin an jusuilu rɔ, mɔɔilu bɛɛ ri se mɛn lɔnna, ka a karan. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Ai ra kɛ bataki ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka mɛn sɛbɛ an na baara rɔ, mɛn sɛbɛnin tɛ duwa ji la wala kaba walan kan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.3</char> Musa la sariya le tɛrɛ sɛbɛla <char style="fk">walan kan</char>. A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 24 kuma diya 12 kɔndɔ. Jeremiya fanan ka a fɔ le ko sariya kura nala, wo ye sɛbɛla mɔɔilu jusu rɔ sani a ye sɛbɛ walan ma. A ragbɛ Jeremiya suran 31 kuma diya 33 ni Esekiyɛli suran 11 kuma diya 19 ni suran 36 kuma diya 26 haan 27 kɔndɔ.</note> kɔni Alla ɲenema la Nii Sɛniman de ka wo sɛbɛ faribanku walan kan ai jusuilu rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Wo jii le an bolo Alla ɲakɔrɔ a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Adon, wo tɛ wo ri ko fanka ye an na an wa baara si kɛ, kɔni an fanka bɔnin Alla le bolo. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ale le ka fanka di an ma, ko an ye teriya kura baara kɛ, mɛn faranin tɛ sariya sɛbɛnin na fɔɔ Alla la Nii Sɛniman, baa sariya sɛbɛnin ye saya le lanala, kɔni Alla la Nii Sɛniman ye nii lakisi le dila.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Nba, sariya baara mɛn ka saya lana, mɛn kɛrɛndɛnnin tɛrɛ kaba walanilu kan, ni wo nanin gbiliya le rɔ haan Musa ɲakɔrɔ tɛrɛ ti se mafɛnɛnna a nɔɔrɔ rɔ, Isirayɛlikailu ti se ii ɲa lɔla a la hali a ɲakɔrɔ nɔɔrɔ tɛrɛ wala banna, ni wo nara wo gbiliya su rɔ, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Alla la Nii Sɛniman baara gbiliya ti nala warala ka tamin wo la wa? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Baara mɛn ye mɔɔilu jalakila, ni wo kɛra gbiliya ri, baara mɛn ye mɔɔilu latelenna Alla ɲakɔrɔ, wo gbiliya ri wara haan ka tamin wo la. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Baa, mɛn kɛnin tɛrɛ gbiliya ri, gbiliya tɛ a rɔ, ni an ka a ni gbiliya fisamantɛ la ɲɔɔn ma. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Awa, baara mɛn tɛrɛ banna, ni wo nanin gbiliya le rɔ, wo rɔ mɛn ye tola habadan, wo la gbiliya dan ye min?<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Wo le rɔ, baa wo jii ye an bolo, an hankili latɛɛnin haan. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Andeilu kɛnin tɛ ikomin Musa, mɛn tɛrɛ faanin birinna a ɲa kun na kosa Isirayɛlikailu kana a ɲakɔrɔ mɛlɛn yen, mɛn tɛrɛ wala banna. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Kɔni ii jusu tɛrɛ ra gbɛlɛnya bakɛ, baa haan bi, ii wa kɛ Teriya Kɔrɔ karanna, a kɛnin ikomin wo faanin ye ye fɔlɔ, ii ma a ɲayen. A ma bɔ fɔlɔ, ka a masɔrɔn a tɛ bɔ fɔɔ Alla la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Hali bi, ii wa kɛ Musa la Kitabu yɔrɔilu karanna, faanin birinnin ii jusu kun na. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Kɔni mɔɔ wa a ɲa latiliminin Maari ma, faanin di bɔ wo rɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.16</char> A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 34 kuma diya 34 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Nba Maari le Nii Sɛniman di. Maari la Nii Sɛniman ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, hɔrɔya le ye. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Andeilu bɛɛ, Alla la gbiliya nɔɔrɔ le mɛlɛnmɛlɛnna an ɲakɔrɔilu rɔ, an tɛ faanin birinna an ɲa kun na. An ye tola yɛlɛmanna ale sawura le rɔ, an na gbiliya ri to warala, ka fara Maari la, mɛn kɛnin Alla la Nii Sɛniman di.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Wo le rɔ, ikomin baara ɲin ye an bolo Alla la kininkinin dɔ, an tɛ tunnagboyala an ma. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Fɔɔ ka an ban maloya ko dokonniilu bɛɛ ma, an tɛ janfan kɛla fewu, an tɛ Alla la kuma yɛlɛmanna. Kɔni an ye tuɲa le jirakala, kosa mɔɔilu bɛɛ ye an na landaɲa lakɔrɔsi ii hankiliilu rɔ Alla ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />An ye Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma mɛn nasela, hali ni wo dokonnin mɔɔilu ma, a dokonnin mɔɔilu le ma mɛnilu ye halakila. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Dunuɲa ɲin maari Setana ra lemɛniyabaliilu hankiliilu ladibi kosa ii kana Alla la Mɔɔ Suwandinin na ko Kibaro Ɲuma yen mɛlɛnmɛlɛnna mɛn kɛnin Ɲenematɔmɔnin na nɔɔrɔ ri. Ɲenematɔmɔnin de Alla sawura ri. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />An tɛ an jɛrɛ la ko kawandili bɔla, fɔɔ an ye a fɔla ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa le Maari ri, a ni an da kɛ ai la baarakɛlailu ri Isa la ko rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Baa Alla mɛn ka a fɔ ko, «Kɛnɛ ye bɔ dibi rɔ,»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.6</char> A Damira suran 1 kuma diya 3</note> wo Alla le ka a la kɛnɛya labɔ damira an jusu rɔ, kosa an ye Alla la gbiliya kɛnɛya lɔn, Ɲenematɔmɔnin ɲakɔrɔ ma.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Kɔni an ka wo niikanfen namara banku daailu le kɔndɔ mɛnilu kɛnin an faribankuilu ri, mɛn ye a yirakala ko fanka fisamante ɲin kɛnin Alla ta le ri, a faranin tɛ andeilu la. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />An da gbɛrɛnnin ɲa bɛɛ ma, kɔni an bundɛnin tɛ; an da kɔndafili kɔni an jiitɛɛnin tɛ; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />an bɛsɛnkɔlɔnteyanin, kɔni an nabilanin tɛ; an nabenin kɔni an halakinin tɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />An ye Isa la saya tɔrɔya tala an fari rɔ waati bɛɛ, kosa Isa la dunuɲaratɛɛ fanan ye yiraka an fari fɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Baa andeilu mɛn ye an nii la, an ye saya da kɔrɔ waati bɛɛ Isa la ko rɔ, kosa a la dunuɲaratɛɛ ye yiraka an faribanku fɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Wo kɔrɔ le ko saya ye baarala andeilu rɔ kɔni nii lakisi le baarala ai le rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />A sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko, «N lemɛniyanin, wo le rɔ n kumara.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.13</char> Yaburi suran 116 kuma diya 10</note> Andeilu le fanan ye kumala lemɛniya rɔ wo hankili kelen dɔ baa an da lemɛniya. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ka a masɔrɔn an ka a lɔn ko Alla mɛn ka Maari Isa lawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, wo le an fanan nawulila ka bɔ saya rɔ Isa fɛ, ka an bɛɛ ladɛn an ɲɔɔn fɛ a ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Wo bɛɛ ye kɛla aile le la ko rɔ kosa Alla la hina, mɛn ye sela mɔɔ siyaman ma, wo ri a kɛ ko baraka ri bila ka wara bakɛ, Alla la gbiliya la ko rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">An jii lanin fen yenbaliilu le rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Wo le rɔ, an tɛ tunnagboyala an ma. Hali an faribanku ye taminna, nii mɛn ye an dɔ, wo ye kɛla a kura le ri lon lon. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Baa, an ye tɔrɔyanin mɛn dɔ waati ɲin dɔ dunuɲa rɔ, wo ma bon, wo ri habadan gbiliya ba lajiriwa an ma, mɛn ka bon ii bɛɛ ri. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />An da an jii la fen yenbaliilu rɔ. Baa fen mɛnilu yenna, woilu tɛ mɛnna, kɔni fen mɛnilu tɛ yenna, woilu ri to habadan!<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />An ka a lɔn ko an nii ye faribanku le rɔ mɛn kɛnin ikomin an sii faaninbon dunuɲa rɔ, ni wo tiɲanda, habadan bon ye an bolo mɛn kɛnin harijeene fari ri Alla baara nɔ, mɔɔilu ma mɛn nadan. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Nba, sisɛn an ye kurunna faaninbon ɲin dɔ, an faribanku, baa an na habadan sii diya lɔɔ ye an mirala kosɛbɛ, kosa harijeene fari ye la an ma ikomin faanin. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Ka a masɔrɔn an wa wo faanin don an kɛnin tɛ butun ikomin an makolon de a ri. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Baa an wa kɛ faaninbon ɲin kɔndɔ, an ye kurunna, kunko ye an ma. An tɛ a fɛ ka faanin kɔrɔn bɔ an ma, kɔni a lɔɔ ye an na, harijeene fari ye la an ma ikomin faanin, kosa fen mɛn ye faala wo ri latunun ɲenemaya rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Alla ka an dan wo ko kelen ma, ka a la Nii Sɛniman di an ma, ka kɛ ikomin fen fɔlɔ mɛn donnin an bolo tɔɔmasere ri kosa an ye la ko natɔilu la.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Wo le rɔ, an jii latɛɛnin waati bɛɛ. An ka a lɔn ko fanin an ye an wara faribanku ɲin dɔ, an ni Maari sii diya tɛma ka jan. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />An ye taamanna lemɛniya le fɛ, kɔni fen yennin tɛ a ri. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Wo rɔ, an jii latɛɛnin. A ri diya an yɛ, ka bɔ faribanku ɲin dɔ, ka wa sii Maari wara. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Mɛn kunnafulen ye an yɛ, ka Alla diya, ni an tora an faribanku rɔ wala ni an bɔra a rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Baa a fɛrɛ tɛ ye fɔɔ an bɛɛ ye lɔ kɛnɛma Ɲenematɔmɔnin na kitila diya ɲakɔrɔ. Mɔɔilu bɛɛ ri ii kɛwaliilu sara sɔrɔn kelen kelen ɲa ma, a ka mɛn kɛ a la dunuɲaratɛɛ rɔ, a ɲuma wala a juuman.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla ni mɔɔilu tɛmala rabɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Baa an ka Maari ɲakɔrɔsilan lɔn, wo le rɔ, an karannin ka mɔɔilu kɔndasu. Alla ka an lɔn kosɛbɛ. N jii lanin a rɔ, ai fanan ka an lɔn ai hankili rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />An karannin tɛ an jɛrɛ lanalima ai yɛ ikɔ tuun. Kɔni an ye fɛrɛ le dila ai ma, ka ai jɛrɛdabaya an na ko rɔ, kosa ai ye se wo mɔɔilu jabila mɛnilu ye ii wasola kɛɲa koilu la sani ii ye ii jɛrɛdabayala jusu rɔ koilu rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ni andeilu ye fatɔ le ri, wo ye Alla le ma; kɔni ni hankilima le an di, wo ye aile le ma. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Baa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na kaninteya le an diyagboyala, baa andeilu lanin a la ko mɔɔ kelen pe le faanin bɛɛ yɛ, wo rɔ, bɛɛ ra faa ale rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />A faara mɔɔ bɛɛ yɛ, ko mɔɔ mɛnilu ye ii nii la, woilu tɛ ii nii la ii jɛrɛ yɛ butun, kɔni fɔɔ mɛn faanin iile yɛ, ka wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Nba, sisɛn an tɛ mɔɔ si jatela adamadenya sila kan butun. Hali an tɛrɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin jatela wo ɲa ma, an tɛ wo kɛla butun. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Wo rɔ, ni mɔɔ si ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ, wo tii ra kɛ dannin kura ri. A su kɔrɔilu ra tamin, a kurailu ra na! <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Wo bɛɛ faranin Alla le la, mɛn ye an ni ale tɛmala rabɛnna a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin fɛ, ka baara don an bolo ko an fanan ye ale ni doilu tɛmala rabɛn: <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />ko Alla tɛrɛ a jɛrɛ ni dunuɲa mɔɔilu tɛmala rabɛnna a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin de fɛ, a tɛrɛ tɛ ii hakɛ jatela butun. A ra wo tɛɛ rabɛn fɛrɛ kibaro karifa an na.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Wo rɔ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin na keladenilu le an di. Alla jɛrɛ le mɔɔilu la wakalila an na kuma fɛ. An ka a fɔ ko, «An da ai madiya Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔɔ rɔ, ai ye ai ni Alla tɛmala rabɛn.» <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Mɛn ma julumun si kɛ, Alla ka wo kɛ julumuntɔ ri andeilu la ko kosɔn, kosa an ye kɛ Alla la telen di Isa baraka rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Baa an ni Alla ye baarala an ɲɔɔn fɛ, an da ai madiya, ai ka Alla la hina mɛn sɔrɔn, ai kana wo jate ko fuu ri. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Baa a fɔnin de ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">«N da i lamɛn n na ladiyaɲɛ waati rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">ka i dɛmɛn niilakisi lon.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.2</char> Esayi suran 49 kuma diya 8</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">N ye a fɔla ai yɛ, sisɛn Alla la ladiyaɲɛ waati le, sisɛn niilakisi lon de.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />An ma sennatufen bila mɔɔ si ɲɛrɔ, kosa fɛɛ si ti nala yenna an na baara la. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Kɔni, an ye an jɛrɛ lanala ɲa bɛɛ ma, ikomin Alla la baaradenilu: tunadiya ba ni tɔrɔya ni ko gbɛlɛnilu ni kɔndafili koilu rɔ; <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />ni ii ka an gbasi, ka an bila kaso la, ni ii ka jama lamurunti, ni an ye baara gbɛlɛnilu ni sunɔɔbaliya ni kɔnkɔ rɔ; <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />sɛninya ni lɔnnin ni diɲɛ ni ɲɛnikɛ ɲuma; ni Alla la Nii Sɛniman, ni kaninteya bɛrɛ rɔ; <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />a ni tuɲa kuma, ni Alla la fanka rɔ; a ni telenbaya mɛn ye an na kɛlɛkɛfenilu ni an na makandan fenilu ri; <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />an wa kɛ gbiliya rɔ, wala maloya rɔ, an wa kɛ tɔɔ tiɲan dɔ wala tɔɔ ɲuma, an telennin adon an da jate janfantenilu ri; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />an miranin ikomin mɔɔ mɛnilu lɔnnin tɛ, adon an lɔnnin kosɛbɛ; an jatenin ikomin an faatɔla le tɛrɛ, adon ai ye a ragbɛ an kɛndɛ le ten; an ɲakankatannin, adon ii ma an faa; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />an jatenin mɔɔ sununninilu ri, adon an sɛwanin waati bɛɛ; an miranin ikomin bolokolonilu adon an da mɔɔ siyaman kɛ fen tiilu ri; foyi tɛ an bolo, adon an ta le fen bɛɛ ri.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Kɔrɛntikailu, an da kuma ai yɛ kɛnɛma, ka ladiyaɲɛ sɔrɔn ai la. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />An ma an na kaninteya dokon ai ma, kɔni ai ra ai ta dokon an ma. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />N da kuma ai yɛ ikomin n denilu. A dahanin, ai fanan ye ladiyaɲɛ sɔrɔn an na.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lemɛniyabaliilu ni lemɛniya mɔɔilu kana ladɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Korɛnti Fɔlɔ suran 10 kuma diya 14 haan 22, Efɛsi suran 5 kuma diya 5 haan 11, Piyɛri Fɔlɔ suran 2 kuma diya 9 haan 12</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ai ni lemɛniyabaliilu kana kun sidi jiri kelen ta ka ai ladɛn ko kelen ma. Baa telenbaya ni telenbaliya ri bɛn ii ɲɔɔn ma ko ɲuman dɔ? Kɛnɛya ni dibi ri bɛn ii ɲɔɔn ma wa? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Ɲenematɔmɔnin ni Setana ri se bɛnna di? Lemɛniya mɔɔ bɛnnin lemɛniyabali ma ɲa ɲuman ma? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Bɛn ɲuman ye Alla batobonba ni joo tɛma? Baa Alla ɲenema la batobon de an di, ikomin Alla ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko, «N di to ii tɛma, ka n mataama ii tɛma, ka kɛ ii la Alla ri, ii fanan di kɛ n na jama ri.» <verse eid="2CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Wo le rɔ, Maari ka a fɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 6:17">«Ai ye bɔ woilu tɛma, ka ai mataa ii la. Ai kana maa fen dahabali si la, wo rɔ nde ri ai lamira.» <verse eid="2CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Maari Sebɛɛtii ka ɲin de fɔ ko, «N di kɛ ai fa ri, ai ri kɛ n dencɛilu ni n denmusoilu ri.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.18</char> A ragbɛ Sarakalaselailu suran 26 kuma diya 12 ni Esekiyɛli suran 37 kuma diya 27 ni Esayi suran 52 kuma diya 11 ni Jeremiya suran 31 kuma diya 9 ni Esekiyɛli suran 20 kuma diya 34 ni Samuwɛla Filana suran 7 kuma diya 14 ni Esayi suran 43 kuma diya 6 ni Hoseya suran 2 kuma diya 1 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Baa Alla ra an lahidi ko ɲinilu bɛɛ la, teriilu, an ye an jɛrɛ lasɛninya ko bɛɛ rɔ mɛn ye an faribanku ni an nii lakɔsɔla, ka to an na sɛninya lakanbalila Alla ɲakɔrɔsilan dɔ.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli la sɛwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Ai jusu rabɛn an yɛ. An tɛ telenbaliya kɛla mɔɔ si la, an tɛ ii lafili, an tɛ ii bolo fen kansonya. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />N tɛ ɲin fɔla ai jalaki ko la, ka a masɔrɔn n tun da a fɔ a fɔlɔ rɔ ko ai la ko ye an jusu rɔ ɲa mɛn ma, an bɛɛ le siimaya ni saya rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />N lanin ai la kosɛbɛ! N ye n wasola aile le rɔ. Ai la ko ye n nalemɛniyala haan ka n dafa. Hali an ye tɔrɔya bɛɛ rɔ, n na sɛwa dan tɛ ye!<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Baa, an sera Masedoniya waati mɛn na, an ma ɲɔɲɔli si sɔrɔn. An tɔrɔnin tɛrɛ ɲa bɛɛ ma. Komasɔsɔlailu tɛrɛ an naminin dɔ, silan tɛrɛ an na. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Kɔni Alla mɛn ye mɔɔ tunnagboilu lalemɛniyala, wo ka an nalemɛniya Tite la na rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />A na ko gbansan tɛrɛ tɛ a ri, fɔɔ a ka lalemɛniya mɛn sɔrɔn ai la. A ka a fɔ an yɛ, n lɔɔ ye ai mirala ɲa mɛn ma, ka sunun, n na ko haminya ba tora ai la. Wo le rɔ, n na sɛwa warara.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Hali n da ai niilafin n na kuma fɛ bataki kɔndɔ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.8</char> Tumadɔ Pɔli ka <char style="fk">bataki</char> do sɛbɛ ii ma mɛn tɛ kɛnin an bolo sisɛn.</note> nde ma nimisa a sɛbɛ la. Hali n nimisara le, n ka a lɔnnin ko wo sɛbɛ tɛrɛ ra ai niilafin waatinin. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Kɔni sisɛn, n sɛwanin, baa ai nimisanin, wo tɛ, kɔni ka a masɔrɔn wo nimisa ra ai la ko kɛ ɲailu yɛlɛman. Alla le ka wo nimisa latɛɛ. Wo le rɔ, ai ma tɔrɔ si sɔrɔn an bolo. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Niilafin mɛn faranin Alla la, wo ye a kɛla le mɔɔilu ye ii kɔnkɔ don ii hakɛ la, ka kisi. Wo le rɔ, nimisa si tɛ wo rɔ. Kɔni nimisa mɛn faranin dunuɲa koilu la, wo ye labanna saya le ma. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Nimisa ɲin mɛn faranin Alla la, ai ye wo ragbɛ: a ra ai kɛ sɛɛbɛnna mɔɔilu ri. Ai kunfannin ai la sɔnbaliya yiraka ko la. Ai mɔnɛnin kojuu ma, ai jusu ra bɔ, n yen ko kunfan ba ye ai la, koɲuma lɔɔ ra ai mira fewu! Ai ye kojuu kɛlailu hakɛilu sara ii la. Ai ra a yiraka ko bɛɛ rɔ ko fɛɛ si tɛ ai la fewu.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Wo rɔ, hali n ka wo bataki sɛbɛ, n ma a sɛbɛ tiɲanninna la ko rɔ wala a ka mɔɔ mɛn tɔrɔ. Kɔni kosa ai ri sɛɛbɛ don an yɛ ɲa mɛn ma, wo ka kan ka bɔ kɛnɛma ai jɛrɛ yɛ Alla ɲakɔrɔ.<verse eid="2CO 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Wo le bɛɛ ka an nalemɛniya, a ni fanan, ka bɔ an nalemɛniya ko la, ai ka Tite lasɛwa ɲa mɛn ma, an sɛwanin wo fanan na haan! Baa ai bɛɛ ra a nii ladiya a ma. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />N tun da ai matɔɔ Tite yɛ. Ai ma n namaloya. Baa an da tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ waati bɛɛ, an ye ai matɔɔ mɛn kɛla Tite yɛ, wo fanan da kɛ tuɲa ri. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />A la ladiyaɲɛ ye tola warala aile le la ko rɔ, a wa labila a la ai bɛɛ kolonin ɲa mɛn ma, a ni ai ka a lasɛnɛ ɲa mɛn ma silan ba rɔ haan ka yɛrɛyɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />N sɛwanin baa n lanin ai la ko bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Bolo ladɛn Jerusalɛmu lemɛniya mɔɔilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />N badenmailu, Alla la hina ye baarala Masedoniya lemɛniya jama tɛma ɲa mɛn ma, an ye a fɛ ai ye wo lɔn. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Ka bɔ ii la tɔrɔya juu rɔ, ii la sɛwa ba ni ii la bolokolonya gbɛlɛn ka sɔli kɛ fonesereya ba rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />N ye ii la sereya bɔla ko ii ka sɔli kɛ le ikomin ii fanka bɛrɛ, a taminda wo la fanan ii ɲɛnikɛ ɲuma rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Ii ka an madiya le kosɛbɛ, ko ii ye wo gbiliya sɔrɔn, kosa an bɛɛ ye jama sɛniman dɛmɛn an ɲɔɔn fɛ Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Ii taminda ten an na miriya la. Ii ka ii jɛrɛ di Maari ma fɔlɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, ka ii jɛrɛ di an fanan ma Alla sawo rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Wo rɔ, Tite mɛn ka hina baara ɲin damira ai wara, an da wo madiya, a ye wa a lakanbali ai tɛma. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Kɔni ai ye ai fanka donna ko bɛɛ rɔ ɲa mɛn ma, lemɛniya ni kuma ni lɔnnin ni wakali bɛɛ ni kaninteya la an yɛ, wo rɔ ai ye ai fanka don hina baara ɲin fanan dɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />N tɛ jamarili lala ai kan, kɔni n wa kɛ doilu la baara la ko fɔla, n ye wo kɛla kosa n di ai la kaninteya kɔrɔbɔ ka a lɔn ko ai wakalinin. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Baa ai ka an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na hina lɔn, ko hali fen tii le tɛrɛ a ri, adon a ka a jɛrɛ kɛ bolokolon di ai la ko rɔ, kosa ai ye kɛ fen tiilu ri a la bolokolonya baraka rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Wo rɔ, n ye n miriya le yirakala ai la ko ɲin dɔ: aile le fɔlɔ ka ai bolo ladɛn sɔli la ko rɔ san taminnin, ka bɔ wo la fanan, aile le fɔlɔ ka a wɔnike. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Awa, ai ye wo baara laban kosa ai bɛnnin ɲɛnikɛ ɲuma mɛn ma a damira, ai ye wo lakanbali wo ɲa ma, ka fara ai la fɛrɛilu la. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Baa ni wɔnike ɲuma ye ai la, Alla ri ai la sɔlifen jate ai bolofenilu kasabi ma, fen mɛn tɛ ai bolo, wo tɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />An tɛ a fɛ, ka donin bɔ doilu kun ma, ka a sii aile kun ma, kɔni an ye a fɛ le bɛɛ ye kaɲa. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Kɔni baa fen siyaman ye ai bolo waati ɲin dɔ, a bɛnnin de, ai ye woilu dɛmɛn mɛnilu mako ye ai bolofenilu la ten. Wo rɔ, ai bolofenilu wa dɛsɛ waati mɛn na, ii fanan di ai dɛmɛn ii bolofenilu la kosa ai bɛɛ ye kaɲa. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />A sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko, «Mɛnilu ka a siyaman matɔmɔ, woilu ta ma siya. Mɛnilu ka dɔɔni matɔmɔ, a ma dɛsɛ woilu fanan ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.15</char> Hɔrɔya suran 16 kuma diya 18.</note><verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tite ni a duɲɔɔilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />An ye baraka bilala Alla yɛ, mɛn ka wo haminya kelen bila n ni Tite jusu rɔ ai yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />An ka mɛn maɲininka Tite la, a ra sɔn wo ma, a ra a wakali fanan, ka a ɲɛnikɛ ko a ye wa ai tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />An ye a ni an badenma do lawala ai ma, lemɛniya jamailu ye matɔɔla a la baara la ko rɔ Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase ko la. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Mɛn taminnin wo la, lemɛniya jama bɛɛ ra ale suwandi, ka wa an malɔ diya, an wa kɛ tala sɔlifen ɲinilu ri waati mɛn na, mɛnilu donin siinin an kun ma Maari jɛrɛ gbiliya ko rɔ, ka an na wakali yiraka doilu dɛmɛn ko rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />An ye a kɛla an hankili la kosa mɔɔ si kana an mafɔ sɔlifen ba ɲinilu mamira ɲa la ko rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Baa mɛn dahanin Maari ɲakɔrɔ a ni mɔɔilu ɲakɔrɔ, an ye karanna wo le kɛ diya.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />An ye mɛn lala wo mɔɔ filailu kan, an ye an badenma do lawala ii malɔ diya. An da a ragbɛ siɲa siyaman, ka a lɔn, ka a ɲɛnikɛ waati bɛɛ. A ra wo ɲɛnikɛ yiraka ten fanan baa a lanin ai la haan! <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Tite le, wo kɛnin n teri ni baaradenɲɔɔ le ri ai tɛma. An badenma mɛnilu lawanin, lemɛniya jama la keladenilu le woilu ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin na gbiliya la ko rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Wo le rɔ, ai ye kaninteya yiraka ii la, wo ni an jɛrɛdabaya kun ai la ko rɔ, kosa lemɛniya jamailu ye a yen.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya mɔɔilu dɛmɛn ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ai ye dɛmɛnnin mɛn kɛla ka bɛn jama sɛniman ma, a tɔnɔ tɛ ye ka bataki sɛbɛ ai ma ka bɛn wo ma. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Baa, n ka a lɔn ko ai ɲɛnikɛ ka ɲin. N ye tola ai matɔɔla Masedonikailu yɛ, n ka a fɔ ko, «Kɛbi sɛrun, Akayakailu rabɛnnin dɛmɛnnin ko rɔ.» Ai ra mɔɔ siyaman nakunfan ai la wakali rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Kɔni, n ye badenma doilu lawala ai ma kosa an ka ai matɔɔ ɲa mɛn ma, wo kana kɛ ko fuu ri. Kɔni a ye tɛrɛn ai rabɛnnin ikomin n ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Ni Masedonika do nara n kɔfɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ, ii ye a tɛrɛn ai rabɛnnin tɛ, an tun di maloya wo rɔ baa an da la ai la, kɔni katara aile ma. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Wo le rɔ, n da a miri ko, a bɛnnin n ye badenma doilu madiya, ka wa ai tɔrɔfɛ n ɲɛrɔ, ai ye wo fonesereya sɔlifen dabɛn, ai tun da lahidi mɛn na kosa a ye di fonesereya rɔ yani a ye kɛ diyagboya ri.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Ai ye ai hankili to ɲin dɔ: mɛn wa si dɔɔnin foyi, wo ye dɔɔnin de kala. Kɔni mɛn wa si ba foyi, wo ri siyaman ka. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Bɛɛ ye sɔli kɛ ikomin a ra a latɛɛ a jusu rɔ ɲa mɛn ma. A kana kɛ nimisa ri wala diyagboya. Mɛn ye sɔli kɛla sɛwa rɔ, wo tii duman Alla yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Alla ri se ai sɔla a la hina dafanin dɔ kosa a ye ai makoilu ɲa ko bɛɛ rɔ waati bɛɛ, ka do fanan to ai bolo baara ɲumailu bɛɛ kɛ diya. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />A sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">«A ra bolokolonilu sɔ fonesereya rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">A la telenbaya ye tola le habadan!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.9</char> Yaburi suran 112 kuma diya 9.</note><verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Nba, Alla mɛn ye si dila sɛnɛkɛla ma a ni dɔɔnnifen, wo ri si di ai ma, ka a lasiyaya, ka ai la telenbaya baara nɔilu lawara. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Ai ri kɛ fen tiilu ri ɲa bɛɛ ma, kosa ai ye to fonesereya rɔ waati bɛɛ. Wo rɔ, mɔɔ siyaman di baraka bila Alla yɛ, an wa ta ai la dinmalifenilu ri ii ma. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Baa ai ye baara mɛn kɛla ɲin di, wo tɛ jama sɛniman makoilu le gbansan ɲala, kɔni a fanan di kɛ sababu ri mɔɔ siyaman di baraka bila Alla yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Mɔɔ siyaman di Alla gbiliya ten ai la baara ɲin tɔnɔ fɛ, baa ai ra sɔn Ɲenematɔmɔnin na kibaro ɲuma rɔ ka wo sila taama a ɲa ma. Ii ri Alla gbiliya ai la fonesereya la ko rɔ baa ai ye ii sɔla ai la fenilu rɔ a ni mɔɔ bɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Wo le rɔ, ii ri Alla matara ai yɛ kaninteya rɔ Alla la hina ba la ko rɔ a ka mɛn di ai ma. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />An ye baraka bila Alla yɛ a la dinmalifen na ko rɔ mɛn ɲɔɔn tɛ ye!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Pɔli ka a la baara ko kun makɛlɛ kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Nde Pɔli, n ye ai madiyala Ɲenematɔmɔnin na fanmajii ni jusu ɲumaya rɔ, hali doilu ye a fɔla ko n ye kumala ai ɲakɔrɔ jɛrɛ majii le rɔ, kɔni ko n wa bɔ ai tɔrɔfɛ, n di jaman ai ma. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />N ye ai madiyala, n wa na ai tɔrɔfɛ, ai kana n diyagboya ka jaman ai ma bakɛ, ka a masɔrɔn n lanin a la, n di susu wo kɛla doilu la fewu, mɛnilu ka ii miri ko an ye an na dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛla adamadenya sila le kan. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Baa an ye dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛla adamadenya le rɔ, kɔni an tɛ kɛlɛ kɛla adamadenya sila kan. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Baa an na kɛlɛkɛfenilu kɛnin tɛ ikomin adamadenilu ta: Alla la kɛlɛkɛ fen fankamailu le ii ri, mɛnilu ri se bon masɔrɔn gbomanilu tiɲanna. An ye wuya miriyailu tiɲanna woilu le la, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />a ni waso mɛn bɛɛ ye bɔla Alla la lɔnnin kanma. An di miriya bɛɛ diyagboya mira kɛ kosa ii ye kolo Alla la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Ai wa wo kolo lakanbali waati mɛn na, an di wuli ka a mirabaliilu hakɛilu sara ii la.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Ai ye koilu kɔkanna le dɔrɔn yenna. Ni mɔɔ doilu ra la a jɛrɛ la ko a ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de rɔ, a ye a miri ɲin ma: ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ta ye an fanan di ikomin ale. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Maari ka fanka di an ma ai fanka don ko le rɔ, ai tiɲan ko tɛ. Hali n ye n jɛrɛ matɔɔla wo la ka tamin dɔɔnin, n ti nala maloyala wo ko la. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />N tɛ a fɛ, a ye kɛ ikomin n ye ai masilanna n na batakiilu le la. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Baa, doilu ye a fɔla ko, «Pɔli la batakiilu gbɛlɛnman, ii fanka ka bon, kɔni ni a jɛrɛ ye an tɔrɔfɛ, fanka tɛ a la, foyi tɛ a la kuma ri.» <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Wo tii ye a miri le ko an ye ɲa mɛn ma an wa kɛ bataki sɛbɛla, an kɛwaliilu ye tola wo ɲa le ma an wa kɛ ai tɛma.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Mɔɔ doilu ye ye mɛnilu ye ii jɛrɛ matɔɔla, adon an tɛ susu an jɛrɛ lala woilu ma wala an ni woilu ye jate an ɲɔɔn fɛ. Ii wa misaliya ta ii jɛrɛ ma, ka ii jɛrɛ la ii jɛrɛ ma, hankilidɔɔ le woilu ri. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Kɔni andeilu ti nala an jɛrɛ matɔɔla ka a dan natamin. Alla ra baara mɛn don an bolo, an tɛ an jɛrɛ matɔɔla ka tamin wo la, baara wo ra se haan ai tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Baa an na jɛrɛ matɔɔ taminnin tɛ an danna, ikomin an tɛrɛ mɛn kɛla ni an tɛrɛ ma na ai wara, baa ande fɔlɔ le nanin haan ai tɔrɔfɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase diya. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Kɔni, an tɛ an jɛrɛ matɔɔla, ka a dan natamin, doilu la baara la ko rɔ. Kɔni an jii lanin a rɔ ko ai la lemɛniya wa wara, an na baara kunda ri wara ai tɛma,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.15</char> A ragbɛ Romi suran 15 kuma diya 17 haan 21 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />kosa mara mɛnilu ye ai wara kɔma, an di se Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lasela woilu ma, sani an ye an jɛrɛ matɔɔ doilu la baara rɔ mɛn kɛnin mɔɔ gbɛrɛilu la baara kunda ri. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Kɔni, a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko, «Ni mɛn ye a jɛrɛ matɔɔla, a ye a jɛrɛ matɔɔ Maari la ko rɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.17</char> A ragbɛ Korɛnti Fɔlɔ suran 1 kuma diya 31 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Baa mɔɔ mɛn ye a jɛrɛ lanala, Alla tɛ wo lamirala fɔɔ Maari wa mɛn nana.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Pɔli ni wuya talibidenbailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ai ri diɲɛ wa, ni n ka fatɔya dɔɔnin fɔ ai yɛ? Kɔni ai diɲɛnin fɔlɔ! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Keleya le n dɔ ai la ko rɔ, keleya mɛn faranin Alla la. A kɛnin de ikomin n ka ai mamira furu le rɔ cɛɛ kelen pe yɛ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin, kosa n ye ai di a ma ikomin sunkurun nasɔlɔnin. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Kɔni ikomin duuma saa ka n ma Hawa majuuwaya ɲa mɛn ma, n silannin ko do ye ai hankiliilu lafili ka ai mataa ai fasanin Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma, fasanin mɛn ye kɔnɔragbɛya ni sɛniman di. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Baa ni mɔɔ do nara Isa gbɛrɛ la ko kawandili bɔ ai yɛ, an ma mɛn na ko kawandili bɔ, wala ni ai ka nii gbɛrɛ sɔrɔn ai ma mɛn sɔrɔn an na, wala ni ai ka Kibaro Ɲuma gbɛrɛ lamɛn, ai ma mɛn namira a fɔlɔ rɔ, ai ri sɔn wo bɛɛ rɔ kosɛbɛ! <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Kɔni mɔɔ ɲinilu mɛnilu ye ii jɛrɛ jatela talibidenba fisamantɛilu ri, n lanin tɛ a la ni woilu taminnin nde la ɲaɲa ma. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Tumado, n ma kusan kumala, kɔni n ka ko lɔn. An da wo lagbɛ ai yɛ ɲa bɛɛ ma.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />N ka Alla la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase ai ma waati mɛn na, n ma foyi lamira ai la, n ka n jɛrɛ majii kosa n ye aile layɛlɛ, n ka hakɛ le kɛ ai la wo rɔ wa? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />N ka fen suɲa ten lemɛniya jama gbɛrɛilu ma, ii ka n sara di, kosa n ye baara ai yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />N tɛrɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ waati mɛn na, makoilu tɛrɛ n na ko do rɔ, n ma mɔɔ si tɔrɔ, baa lemɛniya mɔɔ mɛnilu bɔra Masedoniya, woilu ka n makoilu ɲa ten. N ma sɔn n ye kɛ donin di ai kun ma ko si rɔ, n di n jɛrɛ mira wo ma fanan. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />N da n kali Ɲenematɔmɔnin na tuɲa rɔ mɛn ye n dɔ, mɔɔ si tɛ n jan jɛrɛmatɔɔ ɲin dɔ Akaya jamana rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />N ka wo fɔ nfenna? Ka a masɔrɔn n ma ai kanin wa? Alla ka a lɔn, ko n ka ai kanin!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />N ye mɛn kɛla, n di wo kɛ ikɔ tuun kosa n di fɛrɛ bɔ mɔɔilu bolo mɛnilu ye ko ɲaɲininna ka a fɔ ko iile ni andeilu ka kan, ii la jɛrɛmatɔɔ koilu rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Woilu kɛnin wuya talibidenbailu ni baarala bɔlamiralailu le ri, mɛnilu ka ii jɛrɛ kɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na talibidenbailu misali ri. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Nba, kaba ko tɛ wo ri, baa hali Setana ri se a jɛrɛ kɛla kɛnɛya mɛlɛka misali ri. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Wo rɔ, ko ba tɛ wo ri ni Setana la baarakɛlailu fanan ka ii jɛrɛ kɛ telenbaya baarakɛlailu misali ri. Woilu laban di bɛn ii kɛwaliilu sara ma.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli la tɔrɔya kelaya rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />N di a fɔ ikɔ tuun, mɔɔ si kana n jate hankilidɔɔ ri. Wala ni ai ka a miri wo ɲa ma, ai ye sɔn n ye kɛ hankilidɔɔ misali ri kosa n fanan ye n jɛrɛ matɔɔ dɔɔnin. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />N ye jɛrɛmatɔɔ mɛn kɛla ten, n tɛ wo fɔla Maari la sila kan, kɔni n ye a fɔla hankilidɔɔya le rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Baa mɔɔ siyaman ye ii jɛrɛ matɔɔla adamadenya sila kan, wo le rɔ, n fanan ye n jɛrɛ matɔɔla. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Baa aile kɛnin hankilimailu le ri, ai lakaliya diɲɛla hankilidɔɔilu kɔrɔ! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ai sɔnnin do ye ai kɛ jɔnilu ri, ka ai labaara, ka ai bolofenilu kansonya, ka a jɛrɛ kɔrɔta ai ma, ka ai ɲakɔrɔ gbasi! <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />N ye a fɔ ai yɛ, maloya le wo ri, kɔni an tɛ susu wo kɛla!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Wo rɔ, mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ri susu a jɛrɛmatɔɔla ko mɛn dɔ, n ye kumala ikomin hankilidɔɔ, n fanan di susu n jɛrɛmatɔɔla wo ko rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Heburu le ii ri wa? Ale le n fanan di. Isirayɛlika le ii ri wa? Ale le n fanan di. Iburahima bɔnsɔn de ii ri wa? Ale le n fanan di. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Ɲenematɔmɔnin na baaraden de ii ri wa? N ye kumala ikomin hankilidɔɔ jɛrɛ, kɔni n ka tamin iile la! N da baara gbɛlɛn kɛ ka tamin iile la pon! N da bila kaso la ka tamin iile la pon! Mɔɔilu ka n gbasi gbiɲɛ la ka tamin iile la, n tora saya da kɔrɔ waati siyaman. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Judiyailu ka n gbasi siɲa loolu bonsan ɲa bisawa a ni kɔnɔndɔ (39).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.24</char> A ragbɛ Sariyailu suran 25 kuma diya 3 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Romukailu ka n magbasi gbelekeilu la siɲa sawa. Mɔɔilu ka n mabon kaba la n faa ko rɔ siɲa kelen. Kulun tiɲanda n di kɔɔji tɛma siɲa sawa, n tora kɔɔji rɔ tele kelen su kelen. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />N tɛrɛ taama rɔ waati siyaman gbalo kɔrɔ, bailu ni benkalilailu ni n wara mɔɔ Judiyailu ni siya gbɛrɛilu gbaloilu kɔrɔ. N tɛrɛ so ni wula ni kɔɔjiilu ni wuya lemɛniya mɔɔilu gbaloilu kɔrɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />N tɔrɔra ten baara diya ni waati gbɛlɛnilu rɔ, ka to sunɔɔ baliya rɔ waati siyaman, n tora kɔnkɔ ni min lɔɔ la. Dɔɔnnifen bɛɛ dɛsɛ ra n maa waati siyaman, ka to nɛnɛ rɔ a ni fereya rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Mɛn lanin wo bɛɛ kan, n ye donin mɛn tala lon lon, n haminnin lemɛniya jamailu bɛɛ la ko rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ni mɔɔ do fanka dɔɔman, n fanka fanan di dɔɔya. Ni mɔɔ do bera julumun dɔ, wo ye n jusu janinna le.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Ni n ka kan ka n jɛrɛ matɔɔ, n di n jɛrɛ matɔɔ n na fankatanya rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Maari Isa la Alla a ni a Fa ka a lɔn ko n tɛ wuya fɔla. Tandoli ye di a ma habadan! <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />N tɛrɛ Damasi so kɔndɔ waati mɛn na, jamanatii mɛn ye Mansa Aretasi kɔrɔ, wo ka mɔɔilu lɔ so donda la n mira kanma. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Kɔni mɔɔilu ka n sii see kɔndɔ, ka n nabɔ fɔɲɔ donda la ka n najii so laminin jin kɔma, n ka n porokolo a bolo wo ɲa le ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.33</char> A ragbɛ Keladenilu suran 9 kuma diya 23 haan 25 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Pɔli ka koyen mɛn kɛ ikomin sibo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />N ka kan ka to n jɛrɛ matɔɔla, hali tɔnɔ si tɛ a la. Kɔni koyen mɛnilu kɛnin ikomin sibo, a ni Maari ra ko mɛnilu yiraka, n di woilu fanan fɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />N ka mɔɔ do<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.2</char> <char style="fk">Mɔɔ do</char> ɲin kɛnin Pɔli jɛrɛ ri. A ragbɛ Korɛnti Filana suran 12 kuma diya 7 kɔndɔ.</note> lɔn mɛn ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. Wo layɛlɛra ten haan sankolo sawana. Wo taminda san tan ni naanin. A gbengben, n ma a lɔn ni a faribanku le yɛlɛra sankolo rɔ, wala ni a ka koyen de kɛ ikomin sibo. Alla le ka wo lɔn. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />N ka a lɔn cɛɛ ɲin yɛlɛra ten de, kɔni ni a faribanku yɛlɛra, wala ni a ka koyen de kɛ ikomin sibo, n ma wo le lɔn. Alla le ka wo lɔn. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />A yɛlɛra ten de ka yɛlɛ harijeene. A ka kumailu lamɛn mɛnilu ti se fɔla, a dahanin tɛ mɔɔ ma ka a kuma wo fɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />N di wo mɔɔ su matɔɔ, kɔni nde, n ti nala n jɛrɛ matɔɔla fɔɔ n na fankatanɲa. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ni n tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka n jɛrɛ matɔɔ, n tɛrɛ tɛ kɛla hankilidɔɔ ri, baa n tɛrɛ tuɲa le fɔla. Kɔni n ye n jɛrɛ mirala kosa mɔɔ si kana n jate ka tamin n kɛwaliilu la ai ka mɛnilu yen a ni ai ka mɛnilu lamɛn.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Wo rɔ, Alla ka tɔrɔya ko do latɛɛ n ma ikomin wɔnin wa kɛ faribanku rɔ, mɛn kɛnin tɛrɛ Setana la keladen do ri. Wo ka n ɲakankatan kosa n kana fa waso rɔ, n ka ko lɛnkɛnɛmayanin ba ɲinilu yen. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />N da Maari matara siɲa sawa ka wo tɔrɔya ko bɔ n kan. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Kɔni, a ka n jabi, «N na hina ri i wasa. N fanka ye lakanbalila fankatanɲa le rɔ.» Wo rɔ, n nakaliman n jɛrɛ matɔɔla n na fankatanɲa rɔ, kosa Ɲenematɔmɔnin fanka ye to n fɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Wo le rɔ, n ka n jɛrɛ hɛnɛ fankatanya ni naninniilu ni ko gbɛlɛnilu ni bɛsɛnkɔniya ni kɔndafiliilu rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ. Baa ni n fanka banda waati mɛn na, n ye fanka sɔrɔnna wo waati le rɔ.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli la hamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />N tɛrɛ kumala ikomin hankilidɔɔ, kɔni ai ka n diyagboya ten. Aile le tɛrɛ ka kan de ka n nana, baa mɛnilu ye ii jɛrɛ jatela talibidenba fisamantɛilu ri, woilu taminnin tɛ n na foyi rɔ, hali fen tɛ n di. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Tɔɔmasere mɛnilu ka a yiraka ko talibidenba le mɔɔ ri, an da woilu kɛ ai tɛma tunadiya ba rɔ, ka kɛ tɔɔmasereilu ni kabannakoilu ni ko masilanninilu ri. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />An ka lemɛniya jama doilu lafisaya ai ko ɲa ɲuman ma? Fɔɔ n donin mɛn ma to ai kun ma dɔrɔn. Ai tɛ diɲɛ wo telenbaliya ma wa?<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Sisɛn n dabɛn ko sawana le ɲin di ka wa ai wara. N donin ti nala tola ai kun ma fanan. Ka a masɔrɔn n tɛ ai bolofenilu kɔ, kɔni fɔɔ ai jɛrɛ. Wo rɔ, denilu ma kan ka wodi ladɛn ii sɔrɔnbailu yɛ, kɔni denbaya tiilu le wodi ladɛnna ii denilu yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Wo rɔ, a ri kɛ sɛwa ri, ka n bolofenilu bɛɛ di, ka n jɛrɛ di ai niiilu la ko rɔ. Ni n ka n na kaninteya makafu ai yɛ, ai la kaninteya ri dɔɔya nde ma wa?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />A ye to wo ɲa. N kɛnin tɛ donin di ai kun ma. Kɔni mɔɔilu ye a fɔla, ko baa n kɛnin janfante le ri, n ka ai mira kewuya le la. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />N ka keladen mɛnilu lawa ai ma, n ka ai labaara le wo do fɛ wa? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />N ka Tite madiya le kosa a ye wa ai wara, n ka lemɛniya mɔɔ do<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.18</char> Pɔli tun da <char style="fk">lemɛniya mɔɔ do</char> ɲin na ko fɔ Korɛnti Filana suran 8 kuma diya 22 kɔndɔ.</note> lawa a kɔfɛ. Tite ka ai labaara le wa? An bɛɛ kɔndɔ ko kelen kɛɲa kelen tɛrɛ tɛ a ri an taama ɲa rɔ wa? <verse eid="2CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Tumadɔ, ai mirinin ko an karannin an kun makɛlɛ ko le la ai tɔrɔfɛ. Ɛn-ɛn. An ye kumala Alla le ɲakɔrɔ a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ. N kaninteilu, an ye wo ko bɛɛ kɛla ai la fanka don ko le la. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />N silannin de, n wa na waati mɛn na, n di ai tɛrɛn ɲa mɛn ma, wo tɛ diyala n yɛ, a ni ai fanan di n sɔrɔn ɲa mɛn ma, wo tɛ diyala ai yɛ. N silannin de lagboyaɲɛ ni keleya ni jusumaya ni natabaya ni kuma juu ni mɔɔ mafɔ ni waso ni ko rabasan wa to ai tɛma. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />N silannin de n wa na ikɔ tuun, n na Alla ri n namaloya ai ɲakɔrɔ, ko n di kasi mɔɔ siyaman na ko rɔ mɛnilu tun da julumun kɛ kɔni haan bi ii tɛ ii kɔnkɔ donna ii la ko kɔsɔnilu ni ii la jalonya ni ii la ko haramunninilu la, ii tɛrɛ mɛnilu kɛla.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Lalili laban ni tuwaliilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />A siɲa sawana de ten n ye nala ai wara. A sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko, «Ko bɛɛ ye ɲabɔla sereya fila wala sawa kumakan de ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.1</char> A ragbɛ Sariyailu suran 19 kuma diya 15 kɔndɔ. </note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />N tɛrɛ ra ai lalɔn n na filana rɔ ai tɔrɔfɛ. Baa n tɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ ten, n ye a fɔ wo mɔɔilu yɛ ikɔ tuun mɛnilu tɛrɛ ra julumun kɛ a damira a ni doilu bɛɛ, n ka a fɔ ko, n wa na ai tɔrɔfɛ butun, n ti nala ai kun mafɔla ai julumunilu la ko rɔ, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />baa ai ye ɲininkali kɛla diyagboya la ko ka sereyailu yiraka ai la ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye kumala nde le rɔ. Ale fanka dɔɔyanin tɛ ai la ko rɔ, kɔni fankama le ale ri ai tɛma. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Baa a gbɔngbɔnda le jiri kan fankatanya rɔ, adon a ɲenema le Alla la fanka baraka rɔ. An fanan da kɛ fankatanilu ri ale rɔ, adon an ni a ɲenema le Alla fanka baraka rɔ, ka baara ai yɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Ai ye ai jɛrɛ lakɔrɔsi, kosa ai ye a lɔn ni ai lemɛniyanin. Ai ye ai jɛrɛ fɛsɛfɛsɛ. Ai ma a lɔn wa ko Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye ai rɔ? Fɔɔ ka a tɛrɛn de, ai ra bɔnɔ fɛsɛfɛsɛli rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />N jii lanin a rɔ, ai ri a lɔn ko an ma bɔnɔ fɛsɛfɛsɛli rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />An ye Alla matarala ko ai ti nala kojuu si kɛla. An tɛ wo fɛ kosa jama ye a lɔn ko an da fanka sɔrɔn fɛsɛfɛsɛli rɔ, kɔni kosa ai ye koɲuma kɛ, hali a kɛnin ikomin an tun da bɔnɔ fɛsɛfɛsɛli rɔ. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Baa an ti se foyi kɛla Alla la tuɲa kanma, kɔni an di tuɲa kɛ dɔrɔn. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />An sɛwanin fanka tɛ an na, kɔni fanka ye aile la; a ni an ye Alla matarala le ko ai ye dafa. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Wo le rɔ, n ye ko ɲinilu sɛbɛla ai ma, n tɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ tuma mɛn na, kosa n wa na ai tɔrɔfɛ, n kana ai mira a gbɛlɛnman na n na sebaya rɔ, Maari ka sebaya mɛn don n bolo ai lawakali ko la yani a ye ai halaki.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Tɔɔ la, n badenmailu, ai ye sɛwa. Ai ye karan ka dafa, ka ai ɲɔɔn nalemɛniya, ka to hankili kelen ni jususuma rɔ. Kaninteya tii ni jususuma tii Alla ri to ai fɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ai ye ai ɲɔɔn tuwa badenmaya tuwali sunbuli rɔ. Jama sɛniman bɛɛ ye ai tuwala.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na hina ni Alla la kaninteya ni Alla la Nii Sɛniman bɛn ye to ai bɛɛ fɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>